}

docs {
  # POST /api/admin/prodi
  
  Menambah program studi baru.
  
  ## Request Body
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  |-------|------|----------|-------------|
  | kode_prodi | string | ✅ | Kode prodi (unique) |
  | nama_prodi | string | ✅ | Nama program studi |
  | jenjang | enum | ✅ | D3, S1, S2, S3 |
  
  ## Response Success (201)
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Prodi berhasil ditambahkan",
    "data": {
      "id": "uuid",
      "kode_prodi": "212025",
      "nama_prodi": "Teknik Elektro",
      "jenjang": "S1",
      "createdAt": "2025-01-08T00:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2025-01-08T00:00:00.000Z"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Response Error (409 - Conflict)
  ```json
  {
    "success": false,
    "message": "Kode prodi '212025' sudah terdaftar"
  }
  ```
  
  ## Response Error (422 - Validation)
  ```json
  {
    "success": false,
    "message": "Field berikut wajib diisi: kode_prodi, nama_prodi"
  }
  ```
}
